  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The principal objectives for the project could be summarized as follows: (i) The provision of the road as
part of a network of access roads linking the Free Zones to economic outlets in the Greater Banjul Area (GBA)
for the increased productive capacity of economic activities and (ii) Providing access and the ease of movement
of people, goods, and services</narrative>
  </description>
